  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e (safety net cli.py ~13940-13977). Live: `survey fx --out <symlink to /dev/full>` -> rc=1, 'internal error: OSError: [Errno 28] No space left on device / This is a bug'; `survey --out <chmod 555 dir>/x.json` -> rc=1, 'internal error: PermissionError: [Errno 13]... This is a bug'. New facet: `sketch fx > /dev/full` prints the same two lines, then 'Exception ignored in: <_io.TextIOWrapper name=<stdout>> OSError: [Errno 28]' and exits rc=120. MECHANISM: top-level except-Exception net labels every OSError (ENOSPC/EACCES) 'internal error ... This is a bug'. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-himas."  # 1ef7
